{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c3450d2085837b681aff181ea21b6fe0a9b391890a51e3dfe17c07a1557c9b2a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebab3f447e984db95428ccb6e839e6c70eaadc37081b469136f40c80f73ae3b4",
      "text": "因为有你在注视着我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de00847197a5917b41d7f6185e25ef62f169fbb4153ddfa36b7b7f3fa4497d6c",
      "text": "每天早晨都努力打理发型的隼人。自认为十分讲究，却被哥哥吐槽“根本看不出有什么变化”。尽管如此，隼人依然重新振作起来，原因是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebab3f447e984db95428ccb6e839e6c70eaadc37081b469136f40c80f73ae3b4",
      "text": "因为有你在注视着我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfd52f14ad2990ccfcd2590e3e37c04f82c031e63d042b3205ddb873ebdd9240",
      "text": "（嗯——好像听到了什么声音……\n啊啊，这是闹钟声啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e376dd3bdc31e6bdb65863d188eeb04a13c0ad80b7b26f9517bd24151eedf9f3",
      "text": "已经7点了吗……\n得起床了……哈啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9ee804866744fbe85b21c494309400552118072eecdb40937169c6e2604203c",
      "text": "（忙着准备工作的事，\n搞得太晚睡了啊——……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1919d0cf21ade76088a2f374d0a839a3dfd6584639779a427033694279c0f7b",
      "text": "呼啊～……\n如果一天能多出8个小时，就能多睡会儿了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c348d1a249f0c498b14824a64655391bebffce25a60e6d8118d3eb9500b1ed9",
      "text": "现在可不是说这种话的时候呢。\n唔唔～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9e6b814e2aee9773d2cd02ae8db5265b9f13d3738b91540f7ce3ac94674c3b3",
      "text": "嗯——！\n好！去洗把脸吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a026540da24f5cc2e639cc6e984467e90da438cc1194e25081a4547300f5ee9f",
      "text": "呼——！洗完脸清醒过来了，\n接下来就是弄发型啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b9d79cb7167cc9ee960854f4df86eaf75db78efd9b483655795f688ba746a66",
      "text": "今天也要帅气利落地搞定哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23010acd538df16bf2d370361cb000fca7844207d75d783b79906b5e4fec16b7",
      "text": "哎？总觉得——哪里不对啊。\n再往这边一点……哦，这不挺好嘛挺好嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09fc156e81926655443026afd5112646fc24fd3383be4009d09968c340ecc103",
      "text": "喂隼人，你还没弄完吗？\n今天有工作对吧，赶紧把洗漱间让出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04c0499a5e11d9f57a62a3670db7c0653f17aa3c0ac56c7d37138251527748da",
      "text": "再、再等一下嘛。\n今天我想要比平时更打起干劲来弄！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336048fe6478602a1771d3733dfb1018b001bdfc147b42e7c62374aef9653202",
      "text": "你每天不都这么说吗？\n亏你说得起劲，平时看着根本没什么变化。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a900dfc3ff3ac7ab3010f2eab9be9a8c989e78814ad09d2e0e99fd75699be40",
      "text": "才没有那种事呢！\n我可是很有讲究的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:439854ac94a80c7614a40f21931338a70d9260abbc4bfbe7ed92e4ad1d376143",
      "text": "知道了知道了。\n赶紧给我弄完。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a009dfbaf13f2dcca4174e2635c29d72703d2e5aa6e6e95b37f2b57a944c97b",
      "text": "好——的！……哼哼哼～♪\n哎呀，哇啊，发蜡抠太多了——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a91c3c1cd3998614d6daeec1e52016d5d4a73f573fc563cb7d991b766e2e31a",
      "text": "哈啊……那就冲掉不就得了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c67c368c02439e5010011f3ae440a0956b8462af279ca32c8fe9512dc8c734d9",
      "text": "但是这个很贵的好不好～～\n这可是为了特别的日子准备的专用发蜡啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45baf42d8c30c79577cc8f0a07dbfe1f34773cb501bd9e281119e3ea0fbe135",
      "text": "糟了！已经这个时间了！？\n我、我出门啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2caa5316a1d0ef50efdcee700a18d89bd948b822feb55aafeae4d42be7b45049",
      "text": "早上好！\n●●●●プロデューサー，我赶上了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1c8533370747da339f68e0dfaf80b960ee9c500bb6efa634b8a108e32ff7956",
      "text": "早上好，隼人先生。\n时间完全来得及哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:826d52d9d1a44ee954833f57b61bd8fbbee899de271bbe9078ae31f784adeed4",
      "text": "太好了……卡着点来真是不好意思。\n我马上就去准备采访！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91c426b8f4caeaa2987733c341581f50fcd2cd95f21e97121c95d3abbce47ba6",
      "text": "倒、倒也不用这么着急，时间很充裕的。\n先调整一下呼吸吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82ad17c7fb0af70497500c99f9356a8073331baba955b8ee04f5727df2da5116",
      "text": "嘿嘿……谢谢。稍微细致地弄了下\n发型，结果就花了不少时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcaf27356d79d260aee65b865d4648887a4a841d5714bad6107675c709751583",
      "text": "不过总算是做出了满意的发型！\n采访我也会全力以赴加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2717187d16fb9baf2a1ef5d73a5c7c2ce6f2b2202fffb7772f62f122b9031318",
      "text": "很期待您的表现哦！那么，\n我这就去让采访人员也做好准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000053:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2315fa9ca63efbda113dbb4701e5bf0ef8f2be41b7c475e9536b10b8de9c5d5e",
      "text": "采访开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dadbc2115943b7b4aa32a833771d3c7e140445f1557d2e0f01d098ea66e31a5",
      "text": "那么，能请问一下隼人先生平时在日常生活中\n都有注意些什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:349744036be6956e8e5bf1e207b60dac64d07c4bdb8afe4575d1b9c231a2dd7c",
      "text": "注意的事情啊……啊，对了。弄发型！\n在这种工作的时候，我会花特别多时间在上面！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0949e825b279d64b620eefdb1267c8439490ba0fdfd0b93d0b3bd11b8659530c",
      "text": "虽然老哥……不对，我哥老是说根本看不出变化。\n今天早上也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c224a049eed52c5d2f90246b1f54e888c47721c472d9e103401eb55daa228a0",
      "text": "采访后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd635aa3a5e4f099abf730e94a86bfabaa4783eb9da68e4fb17a7adb5482fc65",
      "text": "采访和拍摄都辛苦了。\n能自始至终气氛热烈真是太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88bebb6864a695fdf06c31ded3c152b54095eaaf801affdc213a60ebfb74db0a",
      "text": "嗯。那位采访人特别会引导话题，\n所以聊得很顺畅呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe1d52833dd9f81df743bbe46ee9e1cc9f6d4f3502549b072f183748282c5e61",
      "text": "特别是弄发型的话题，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d0ad6bd0294991828d470690a447779221e475efcf21b203aba0c17232b7d83",
      "text": "对啊。我虽然这样，每天早晨都很努力在弄的。\n尤其是今天还有拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771086d331f2227c32995f3034d57c3de06ec7aa3ac8be8c9c5e5c3d600bcdda",
      "text": "照片拍得帅气的话，\n粉丝说不定也会变多……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c771351606f307eee1ba3d071282854869db693daf56396a7ebb48e09d2e836",
      "text": "说不定班里的女生也会夸“秋山同学好帅！”\n什么的……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4dab1642e64d9cce3d8bfadfbd82d5b607bb0bc47a1dde6d2bf332c6102b578",
      "text": "可是老哥老是说我“根本看不出变化”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6af94aa3392e061aa5b357cf93683d36af9d79172fbc1495b2adef37e7a96e1",
      "text": "我明明自己很讲究的。\n果然看不出来的话，弄这些也没意义吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d249f3dcef31269f29202037db0c70a5660f056730c6d6bc7ce72e19af625275",
      "text": "没有那种事！\n我觉得隼人先生的这份讲究非常了不起哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cd432bd4feaa490b0e8cace88ec97790f43a5d7efd6a666d975b7d1e005c3fd",
      "text": "哎……了、了不起？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc5596bbe1ae188e769a89ed2c0daf2cea7ad7411111f631aa7b447f52e1faf9",
      "text": "是的。打理发型这种事，\n其实意外地既花时间又花工夫。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64c65fce1f4b1ec13053e9b20d5d938a8137f9245bd7acad639765e1e0578290",
      "text": "能每天坚持做这件事，已经非常厉害了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1df307a90f6835e9ae773aec08683eacf27c5e7cb86ef107b11041ade6223c9b",
      "text": "是、是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e9bc3ebac2874a4841ee67a43a33d6b147f519fda6271cdcffbdc1b663b4ed7",
      "text": "而且今天的发型，听说您是特意为了采访花时间打理的，\n我也很高兴哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad3d309b7fb1e4bc12f15b5d333199744f35676147884c2c228b4c5ff81dc3b",
      "text": "嘿嘿……这样啊。\n看来还是没白弄嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d51a6775468470a27ca9a1e11f409884b6201ba7d78d14560a258826729f1103",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！\n我今后也会继续把发型弄得帅帅的过来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000052:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06272b7f481e462932928402fe0f12f2119475f7054d73eedde38807d87be0ff",
      "text": "翌日早晨……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c179ce70ed80663bc4aaf8bf712f9de953b3500c7ddc7d1c5079d0c4d1cbd836",
      "text": "唔——耳朵旁边的部分总觉得差点意思啊——\n再稍微定型一下可能会更服帖吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1dc923decc90900294ad20434001d412fc8f8497c65b538e5d0c997991e1225",
      "text": "你……又在弄啊？\n每天弄不腻吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a190732ae4b6b1a639a131c406657b1e145d099e69c55d4c0a185f24130ff072",
      "text": "真是的，有什么关系嘛！\n我爱怎么样就怎么样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d225474980b2d3a7e987705e73373ffdbe6589442256b47ac80067e42296d772",
      "text": "而且，也有人一直在好好看着我呢。\n所以我今后也会继续努力弄发型的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
